ce caretaker. Three officers. No agency identified. They told me they were =
concerned about what I was posting online.</p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">I recorded them leaving.</p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">I told them I wouldn't speak without an attorney.<=
/p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
